# Raiden Chevreuse Yae Mavuika. ~24s Rot. Raikou with Mavuika, where Mavuika & Yae/Raiden burst in alternate rotations. Q 6[C2D] Mavuika/Q N4E 2N4D N3 Raiden. Healer build Chevreuse.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
